WEBVTT

00:05:29.208 --> 00:05:31.518
All that changes if I can connect you

00:05:31.542 --> 00:05:32.809
with a phone

00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:36.018
into farmers, fertilizers
and cooperatives,

00:05:36.042 --> 00:05:37.809
give you cropping information,

00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:39.476
rainfall information,

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.268
enable you to sell your produce
in a better marketplace, online,

00:05:43.292 --> 00:05:46.226
receive the money into an account online,

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.809
that is a complete game changer.

00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:51.768
Something again
that farmer's cooperatives,

00:05:51.792 --> 00:05:53.309
local governments,

00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:56.434
banks and companies like ours
can help facilitate,

00:05:56.458 --> 00:05:58.643
in Africa, we're doing it in India,

00:05:58.667 --> 00:06:01.309
we're doing it in a bunch
of countries around the world.